  "hints": [
    "If you can only move right or down, the ways to reach cell (r, c) equals ways(r-1, c) + ways(r, c-1) (or 0 if grid[r][c] == 1).",
    "Use a 1D DP row `dp = [0] * cols` initialized with `dp[0] = 1` (if start is open); for each row, set `dp[c] = 0 if obstacle else dp[c] + dp[c - 1]`.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  dp = [0] * cols; dp[0] = 1 if grid[0][0] == 0 else 0\n  for row in grid:\n      for c in range(cols):\n          if row[c] == 1: dp[c] = 0\n          elif c > 0: dp[c] += dp[c - 1]\n  return dp[-1]"
  ],
